# Local-only files — never published to GitHub Pages.
#
# The Caddy root CA cert is served on the LAN (https://<lan-ip>:8443) so a new
# phone can trust the local origin. It is meaningless on GitHub Pages, which
# has a real publicly-trusted certificate, so it is excluded from the public
# site. The menu hides its "Install the CA certificate" row automatically when
# the site is not served from a bare IP address.
caddy-root-ca.crt

# Local scratch
tmp/
*.log
